        m_CallState: 2
  Instructions:
  - Look at the directional pad on the screen.
  - 'This square shows your position: try stepping forward, back, left and right
    to see it move.'
  - Step so that you're standing straight and the position icon is in the centre.
  - 'When a direction lights up, take one step in that direction. '
  - When the centre square lights up again move back to the centre.
  - You will always move back to the centre between steps!
  - 'Remember not to lean, always take a definite step. '
  InstructionText: {fileID: 1213377849}
  endTutorial:
